/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1333","id":5104842237,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx8aUc8AAAABMEW1_Q","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1333","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1333.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1333.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1333","number":1333,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix: make the retry-safe create and authoring recovery journeys pass on Windows","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nFix the Windows create-retry and lost-authoring-task journeys while preserving their assertions about duplicate prevention and recovery. Also fix write-back shadow refreshes losing the link to an already-created board item, and extend the retry journey to verify that link survives a later update.\n\n## Why\n\nThese journeys failed on every Windows change, hiding real regressions in write-back and plan-store recovery. The retry investigation also exposed an engine defect that made shadows forget which board item they had created.\n\n## Additional info\n\n- **Windows origin mismatch — repaired in the journey.** The expected origin used the host's path separator (`\\`), while the store already writes `/` on every platform. The [create-retry failure log](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/actions/runs/41264252402/job/124723674670) shows the issue carrying the slash-separated origin. The journey now normalizes its expected origin; a Linux regression test supplies the exact Windows path form from that log.\n- **Windows recovery race — repaired in the journey.** The [lost-authoring-task failure log](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/actions/runs/41264252402/job/124723674616) shows the image assertion finding zero assets. The local-md store writes the task document before installing its assets, but the journey waited only for the document. It now waits for assets too, retaining the existing image assertions. A Linux regression test stages that intermediate state in the real store.\n- **Intermittent missing shadow link — repaired in the engine.** Refreshing shadows before each write-back attempt preserved `onetaskgraph.creating` but discarded `onetaskgraph.copies` and `onetaskgraph.copy_locations`. Refreshes now preserve all three. The separate rewrite consumed by a creating copy still preserves only the create-in-flight record, avoiding stale links. The failure occurred in one of four Linux runs at base `781d7986`; releasing the journey's anchor after creation reproduces the loss deterministically. Unit and journey assertions cover preservation of both the link and its location.\n\nThe worker verified that each regression test fails with the corresponding base behavior restored. Reported final-tree checks passed: both affected Linux modules (85 tests), 20 consecutive create-retry runs, Windows GNU cross-target type-checking, formatting, Clippy, and diff-scoped llmlint. The Windows check was type-checking only, not a linked or executed Windows test run. At the engine-fix commit, 55 write-back unit tests and 371 related end-to-end tests also passed; subsequent changes were comments and an additional journey assertion.\n\nTwo scoped `tests_mirror_real_usage` suppressions accompany the helper regression tests: they exercise the journeys' own defective logic with Windows conditions that the binary cannot reliably produce on Linux.","created_at":"2026-11-01T05:57:57Z","updated_at":"2026-11-01T07:31:08Z","closed_at":"2026-11-01T07:31:07Z","merged_at":"2026-11-01T07:31:06Z","merge_commit_sha":"307f28910097ca3c1014d8a520233a0ec16826a6","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1333/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1333/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1333/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/ce04c2bf98d70250a040e0d2d6af488690630f6a","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/follow-up-sync-in-store/pipeline-windows-journeys","ref":"nick/follow-up-sync-in-store/pipeline-windows-journeys","sha":"ce04c2bf98d70250a040e0d2d6af488690630f6a","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1327438417,"node_id":"R_kgDOTx8aUQ","name":"onepipeline","full_name":"nickderobertis/onepipeline","private":false,"owner":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/