Vg","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1325","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1325.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1325.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1325","number":1325,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(deps): link the plan store that makes a create safe to retry and guards its writes","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nLink onetaskgraph 0.12.14 across the engine and companion CLI, keeping copies on the store’s defaults. Preserve create intents across write-back retries and wait out active create leases so interrupted creates recover without duplicating board items. Add regression journeys for a dropped GitHub create response and a cancelled create’s lease, and adapt the Linear loopback to store-supplied create IDs.\n\n## Why\n\nA host’s plan-store CLI must match the store release its engine links. This update makes retry-safe creates and guarded copy options available to hosts’ follow-up tooling, while the engine retains its existing copy policy and gains safe recovery for its own creates.","created_at":"2026-10-31T17:53:54Z","updated_at":"2026-10-31T21:52:50Z","closed_at":"2026-10-31T21:52:47Z","merged_at":"2026-10-31T21:52:47Z","merge_commit_sha":"40153d7ac2dadd23f9eacabaae33139181c48175","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1325/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1325/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1325/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/808b72721b8ad4565d93ffc5b19aaba0515a8279","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/1316/pipeline-link-follow-up-sync","ref":"nick/1316/pipeline-link-follow-up-sync","sha":"808b72721b8ad4565d93ffc5b19aaba0515a8279","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderober