_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1320"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1320"},"issue":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1320"},"comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1320/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1320/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1320/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/07bb9f376c964129a3c876f20cfa16b965844568"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1321","id":5093377866,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx8aUc8AAAABL5bHSg","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1321","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1321.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1321.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1321","number":1321,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"chore: release v0.97.0","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\n\n\n## 🤖 New release\n\n* `onepipeline`: 0.96.2 -> 0.97.0 (⚠ API breaking changes)\n\n### ⚠ `onepipeline` breaking changes\n\n```text\n--- failure constructible_struct_adds_field: struct exhaustively constructible through public API adds field ---\n\nDescription:\nA pub struct that could be exhaustively constructed with a literal using only public API has a new pub field, breaking existing exhaustive literals.\n        ref: https://doc.rust-lang.org/reference/expressions/struct-expr.html\n       impl: https://github.com/obi1kenobi/cargo-semver-checks/tree/v0.51.0/src/lints/constructible_struct_adds_field.ron\n\nFailed in:\n  field TaskRecord.priority in /tmp/.tmpOsgDeb/onepipeline/src/plan.rs:1606\n\n--- failure enum_struct_variant_field_added: pub enum struct variant field added ---\n\nDescription:\nAn enum's exhaustive struct variant has a new field, which has to be included when constructing or matching on this variant.\n        ref: https://doc.rust-lang.org/reference/attributes/type_system.html#the-non_exhaustive-attribute\n       impl: https://github.com/obi1kenobi/cargo-semver-checks/tree/v0.51.0/src/lints/enum_struct_variant_field_added.ron\n\nFailed in:\n  field phase of variant HumanItemsCommand::Raise in /tmp/.tmpOsgDeb/onepipeline/src/human_items.rs:551\n  field context of variant HumanItemsCommand::Raise in /tmp/.tmpOsgDeb/onepipeline/src/human_items.rs:554\n\n--- failure enum_variant_added: enum variant added on exhaustive enum ---\n\nDescription:\nA publicly-visible enum without #[non_exhaustive] has a new variant.\n        ref: https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/reference/semver.html#enum-variant-new\n       impl: https://github.com/obi1kenobi/cargo-semver-checks/tree/v0.51.0/src/lints/enum_variant_added.ron\n\nFailed in:\n  variant HumanItemsCommand:Config in /tmp/.tmpOsgDeb/onepipeline/src/human_items.rs:591\n  variant HumanItemsCommand:Watch in /tmp/.tmpOsgDeb/onepipeline/src/human_items.rs:598\n```\n\n<details><summary><i><b>Changelog</b></i></summary><p>\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.97.0](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/compare/v0.96.2...v0.97.0) - 2026-10-31\n\n### Added\n\n- operate durable human items across host sessions ([#1317](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1317))\n</blockquote>\n\n\n</p></details>\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [release-plz](https://github.com/release-plz/release-plz/).","created_at":"2026-10-31T01:46:09Z","updated_at":"2026-10-31T04:07:30Z","closed_at":"2026-10-31T04:07:28Z","merged_at":"2026-10-31T04:07:28Z","merge_commit_sha":"99b620df27c00177d4d69e0c4765302bbc16a21a","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1321/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1321/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1321/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/fac7a97a4dfba1f294a08f2fba7e0712e228b7a9","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:release-plz-2026-10-31T01-46-06Z","ref":"release-plz-2026-10-31T01-46-06Z","sha":"fac7a97a4dfba1f294a08f2fba7e0712e228b7a9","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","htm