id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1280","id":5057939589,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx8aUc8AAAABLXoIhQ","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1280","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1280.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1280.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1280","number":1280,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"docs: design onepipeline's per-command crate layout and measure its test skips","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nAdd a modularization design with command-owned crates and arguments, focused engine subsystems, a thin dispatcher and staged migration. Supporting scripts classify cycle edges, validate the proposed DAG, map all 1,922 e2e tests in the pinned source snapshot, and compare replay selection against real Nx. The design includes smaller test suites and recorded-fixture integration tests with binary recorder journeys. No files under `src/`, `crates/` or `tests/` change.\n\n## Why\n\nDetermine whether real modularization can shorten CI and the local gate by letting Nx skip work a change cannot reach, without removing or sampling tests. Replace the catch-all crate proposal with explicit boundaries and reproducible estimates that can be reviewed before undertaking a source refactor.\n\n## Additional info\n\nThe final 144-PR replay projects **13.14% of suite runs skipped**, with estimated test-seconds savings of **12.11% on Linux, 12.00% on macOS, 11.93% on Windows and 12.03% locally**. The crate-only model projects 13.52% of suite runs skipped and 6.39%/6.21%/6.09% of CI test-seconds skipped; historical suite-run baselines are 2.1% today and 4.7% for the four-crate proposal. Suite counts differ between models.\n\nThese are projections against source pinned at `51eb9aa2765fb1ba61c99c819587a88a401a3591`, not benchmarks of an implemented refactor. The design records remaining shared-input fan-out, compile-cost scenarios and migration steps. It does **not** establish a measured local-gate speedup or reach the 30-minute job target; new crate-level test costs remain unmeasured.\n\nSee the [target layout](docs/modularization-target-layout.md), [test split](docs/modularization-test-split.md) and [engine-test migration and final replay](docs/modularization-engine-tests.md).","created_at":"2026-10-28T21:25:32Z","updated_at":"2026-10-31T02:10:15Z","closed_at":"2026-10-31T02:10:15Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"a41b6fd8dd1cbbd5d348922122df89fd71776776","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1280/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1280/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1280/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/fcc45eb81439a7c1e44d2723c3d87882bea34ee7","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/ci-time-budgets-wave1/onepipeline-modularization-design","ref":"nick/ci-time-budgets-wave1/onepipeline-modularization-design","sha":"fcc45eb81439a7c1e44d2723c3d87882bea34ee7","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/