,"clone_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline","homepage":null,"size":24249,"stargazers_count":1,"watchers_count":1,"language":"Rust","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":2,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":252,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":2,"open_issues":252,"watchers":1,"default_branch":"main"}},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1280"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1280"},"issue":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1280"},"comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1280/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1280/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1280/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/fcc45eb81439a7c1e44d2723c3d87882bea34ee7"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1317","id":5085211888,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx8aUc8AAAABLxos8A","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1317","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1317.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1317.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1317","number":1317,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat: operate durable human items across host sessions","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nMake human items a durable queue across manager sessions, with CLI/SDK actions, owner watch delivery, task-store projection and composable work, plan and host holds. Add shared configuration, ticket-review and approval hooks, automatic incident recovery, and recoverable indexed reads with a saved-telemetry read budget.\n\n## Why\n\nA single visible queue lets the operator spend attention on the most urgent human work and keeps unrelated development moving while a person decides.\n\n## Additional info\n\nDisabled by default; enable through repository `.onepipeline/config.yaml`, with host-local overrides. CLI, SDK and dispatch launches share the effective configuration. Questions stay in the journal and bus; only tasks project to the configured task source through onetaskgraph 0.12.13.\n\nEligible human nodes automatically create items. Answering or completing releases their work; dismissing drops the step and detaches its dependents. Ending a run dismisses its remaining run-blocking items while independent host holds remain open. Design-review completion uses the configured approval authority; stale evidence refuses completion and replaces the obsolete task.\n\nThe read-budget target records complete CLI elapsed time over a million-event fixture. Its 0.45-second threshold applies to unchanged warm reads; cold rebuilds and tail catch-up are disclosed separately.\n\nAdditional interface proposals remain open in [docs/contract-divergences.md §144](docs/contract-divergences.md#144-the-live-human-item-surface-names-what-its-task-did-not--open).\n\n**Separate base fix, outside the human-items work:** `Maintenance::close` could drop a sweep's last retirement report while it was still passing through the journal relay, a race already on `main` since #1200. The closing driver now waits for that report, with regression coverage in `maintenance::tests::a_closing_driver_records_the_retirement_its_relay_hands_on_late`. The branch also makes configuration-path assertions tolerate symlinked temporary directories and synchronizes the traced-read budget test with the blocked reader.","created_at":"2026-10-30T13:36:09Z","updated_at":"2026-10-31T01:43:41Z","closed_at":"2026-10-31T01:43:39Z","merged_at":"2026-10-31T01:43:39Z","merge_commit_sha":"e357c4f0d172762219fa9024417725d0663c53c1","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1317/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1317/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1317/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/bf3f76c2118ef6e400a1de264e60e1cb6abb2419","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/1271/item-runtime","ref":"nick/1271/item-runtime","sha":"bf3f76c2118ef6e400a1de264e60e1cb6abb2419","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1327438417,"node_id":"R_kgDOTx8aUQ","name":"onepipeline","full_name":"nickderobertis/onepipeline","private":false,"owner":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobert