ived_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nRun a home project and its linked member projects as one plan, honoring dependencies across sources and writing each task’s status and settlement where it lives. Adopt onetaskgraph 0.2.57 so repository-based routing also places live additions into member projects, creating them when needed.\n\n## Why\n\nExampleOrg work belongs in Linear, while personal libraries belong in GitHub Projects. Changes spanning both need one launch and one dependency graph, with progress visible in each team’s tracker and placement determined by repository.\n\n## Additional info\n\nExisting ledgers remain readable. Runs journalled with a member task’s new `source` field cannot be adopted by older engine versions.","created_at":"2026-10-02T19:13:08Z","updated_at":"2026-10-30T15:18:14Z","closed_at":"2026-10-02T22:18:50Z","merged_at":"2026-10-02T22:18:50Z","merge_commit_sha":"2226cb618fe12643c3e182c05f7b92321ccbe2c3","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/703/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/703/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/703/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/5de4e983f3545148f6bacad4995076bdc1b4a764","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/675/op-multi-source-plans","ref":"nick/675/op-multi-source-plans","sha":"5de4e983f3545148f6bacad4995076bdc1b4a764","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://gi