ents_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1302","id":5075706065,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx8aUc8AAAABLokg0Q","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1302","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1302.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1302.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1302","number":1302,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(deps): link the plan store that sends no write when an unchanged plan is copied again","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nLink onetaskgraph 0.12.12 so copying an unchanged plan into Linear again sends no write. Add regression coverage through the linked plan store and extend the Linear loopback to retain and validate task dependencies.\n\n## Why\n\nThe orchestration host copies private plans in Linear after every review, finish and approval. Avoiding redundant writes saves Linear API quota, prevents unnecessary notifications to followers and stops dependency-link churn.\n\n## Additional info\n\nDependencies changed against the base:\n\n- `Cargo.toml`: `onetaskgraph-core`, `onetaskgraph-plugin-api` and `onetaskgraph-local-md` move from `=0.12.11` to `=0.12.12`. Add `onetaskgraph-linear = \"=0.12.12\"` as a workspace dependency and inherit it in dev-dependencies for test support.\n- `Cargo.lock`: `onetaskgraph-core`, `onetaskgraph-plugin-api`, `onetaskgraph-local-md`, `onetaskgraph-linear`, `onetaskgraph-github-projects` and `onetaskgraph-in-memory` all move from 0.12.11 to 0.12.12. Add the already-transitive `onetaskgraph-linear` to `onepipeline`'s dependency list; no other lock entries change.\n- The template journeys' `onetaskgraph-version` moves to 0.12.12, and the existing one-release lock check includes the new direct test dependency.\n\nThe regression journey copies a project document, three tasks and a dependency, then asserts that copying the unchanged plan again sends no Linear write and preserves the stored content and relations. With every `onetaskgraph-*` crate at 0.12.11, and again at 0.12.7, the first copy's assertions pass and the journey fails at its no-write assertion (`tests/e2e/linear_launch.rs:564`): the second copy sends 10 Linear writes, 6 `IssueUpdate`, 2 `IssueRelationDelete` and 2 `IssueRelationCreate`. The journey was unchanged for both runs. The engine does not compile against 0.12.7 as it stands, so that comparison used a throwaway checkout with the `TargetNativeNeedsOne` and `NotATask` match arms and corresponding unit-test cases removed from `src/writeback.rs`; those variants were added in 0.12.9. Those compatibility edits are not part of this branch.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","created_at":"2026-10-29T21:19:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-30T07:30:05Z","closed_at":"2026-10-30T07:30:03Z","merged_at":"2026-10-30T07:30:03Z","merge_commit_sha":"f139fb33c693c1a86a1739a82892b7d00d9612ae","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1302/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1302/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1302/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/37bf7f4b4efa9fc14cc6feb694c82c1b5b5f9ba9","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/linear-stored-content-verification/pipeline-link-linear-recopy","ref":"nick/linear-stored-content-verification/pipeline-link-linear-recopy","sha":"37bf7f4b4efa9fc14cc6feb694c82c1b5b5f9ba9","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/even