llowers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1300","id":5072822600,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx8aUc8AAAABLl0hSA","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1300","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1300.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1300.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1300","number":1300,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(deps): link the onejudge that keeps a stopped observer's turn from reading as lost","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nLink onejudge 0.22.1 and refresh compatible engine dependencies. Ask observer graphs to stop before terminating their processes, so settlement no longer reports an in-flight monitor turn as lost. Add end-to-end regression coverage for settlement cancellation and genuine monitor failures.\n\n## Why\n\nFalse monitor failures make ai-orchestrator’s monitor journey fail at roughly half of run settlements, randomly blocking its pre-push gate and delaying needed changes. Releasing this engine change delivers the fix to ai-orchestrator.","created_at":"2026-10-29T17:42:13Z","updated_at":"2026-10-30T03:54:16Z","closed_at":"2026-10-30T03:54:13Z","merged_at":"2026-10-30T03:54:13Z","merge_commit_sha":"d2beb8bc4844ef3d4d21a52e5920cc790f69805e","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1300/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1300/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1300/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/e52ea21785de50dedda2453019f5b2ff1d786755","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/Share-one-Codex-app-server-across-dispatches-and-budget-network-data-per-launch/onepipeline-link-onejudge-cancel-fix","ref":"nick/Share-one-Codex-app-server-across-dispatches-and-budget-network-data-per-la