ef":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1300/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/e52ea21785de50dedda2453019f5b2ff1d786755"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1294","id":5068661565,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx8aUc8AAAABLh2jPQ","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1294","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1294.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1294.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1294","number":1294,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"chore: release v0.96.0","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\n\n\n## 🤖 New release\n\n* `onepipeline`: 0.95.7 -> 0.96.0 (⚠ API breaking changes)\n\n### ⚠ `onepipeline` breaking changes\n\n```text\n--- failure constructible_struct_adds_field: struct exhaustively constructible through public API adds field ---\n\nDescription:\nA pub struct that could be exhaustively constructed with a literal using only public API has a new pub field, breaking existing exhaustive literals.\n        ref: https://doc.rust-lang.org/reference/expressions/struct-expr.html\n       impl: https://github.com/obi1kenobi/cargo-semver-checks/tree/v0.51.0/src/lints/constructible_struct_adds_field.ron\n\nFailed in:\n  field Node.human_item in /tmp/.tmpBd2XRY/onepipeline/src/plan.rs:1314\n\n--- failure enum_variant_added: enum variant added on exhaustive enum ---\n\nDescription:\nA publicly-visible enum without #[non_exhaustive] has a new variant.\n        ref: https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/reference/semver.html#enum-variant-new\n       impl: https://github.com/obi1kenobi/cargo-semver-checks/tree/v0.51.0/src/lints/enum_variant_added.ron\n\nFailed in:\n  variant Command:HumanItems in /tmp/.tmpBd2XRY/onepipeline/src/cli.rs:171\n```\n\n<details><summary><i><b>Changelog</b></i></summary><p>\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.96.0](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/compare/v0.95.7...v0.96.0) - 2026-10-30\n\n### Added\n\n- declare additive human action item contracts ([#1297](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1297))\n\n### Fixed\n\n- *(deps)* link the onevcs whose public boundary check never refuses a removal ([#1301](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1301))\n- prove the human items schema exporter without compiling inside a test ([#1304](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1304))\n- *(deps)* link the store that lets a private GitHub home hold public tasks ([#1299](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1299))\n- *(test)* keep the pooled-slot tier green on Windows, where its tests do not apply ([#1295](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1295))\n- *(npm)* keep the Windows node_modules/.bin launch's output the engine's own ([#1291](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1291))\n</blockquote>\n\n\n</p></details>\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [release-plz](https://github.com/release-plz/release-plz/).","created_at":"2026-10-29T13:13:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-30T03:21:49Z","closed_at":"2026-10-30T03:21:47Z","merged_at":"2026-10-30T03:21:47Z","merge_commit_sha":"7b6a7bbb6841f5cb0d673a6b3a9945973cfa78de","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1294/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1294/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1294/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/c227cadc3841958a9530480e7d0a000555d0a59d","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:release-plz-2026-10-29T13-13-31Z","ref":"release-plz-2026-10-29T13-13-31Z","sha":"c227cadc3841958a9530480e7d0a000555d0a59d","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/even