_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nLink onevcs 0.57.4 so public publication accepts branches that merge a base which already removed a private-term-bearing line. Add end-to-end coverage through `publish-branch` and run closeout, preserving refusals for added terms—even when later removed.\n\n## Why\n\nRuns publish through the onevcs crate linked into the engine. Adopting its fix prevents branches that merge a scrubbed base from failing publication and requiring a manual recut.","created_at":"2026-10-29T19:00:04Z","updated_at":"2026-10-30T01:13:05Z","closed_at":"2026-10-30T01:13:03Z","merged_at":"2026-10-30T01:13:03Z","merge_commit_sha":"f07b3a259d3e6332d0a5f0bd4d7ee2f60affed1f","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1301/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1301/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1301/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/5c4e960b06da76cc395b27e69c679c62cd5169ea","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/1275/relink-engine-onevcs","ref":"nick/1275/relink-engine-onevcs","sha":"5c4e960b06da76cc395b27e69c679c62cd5169ea","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickdero