304.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1304","number":1304,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix: prove the human items schema exporter without compiling inside a test","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nRun the prebuilt human-items schema exporter directly in its integration test, removing compilation during the test while retaining the schema and fixture assertions. Include the executable in nextest archives so archived reruns work too. The documented exporter command, published schemas, fixture, and public types remain unchanged.\n\n## Why\n\nCompilation during this test exceeded the coverage sweep’s timeout and blocked releases. Removing that runtime compilation addresses the blocker so the human action item contracts can ship and the host-view UI work can begin.","created_at":"2026-10-29T21:49:45Z","updated_at":"2026-10-30T01:04:35Z","closed_at":"2026-10-30T01:04:33Z","merged_at":"2026-10-30T01:04:33Z","merge_commit_sha":"3441626