ps://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nLink onetaskgraph 0.12.11 across the engine and template journeys. Live-added public-repository tasks in a private GitHub Projects home now get a canonical issue in a private repository, with only a neutral projection on the public board.\n\nAdd a real-CLI regression journey using the linked store and a GitHub transport double validated against that release’s pinned schema. No engine API changes were needed. Also update libz-sys to 1.1.31 to address RUSTSEC-2026-0418.\n\n## Why\n\nEvery dispatched node reads and writes its plan through the linked store. Updating it removes the refusal when a live edit adds public-repository work to a private home, and lets the host adopt the matching fixed store CLI.","created_at":"2026-10-29T17:26:54Z","updated_at":"2026-10-30T00:47:29Z","closed_at":"2026-10-30T00:47:26Z","merged_at":"2026-10-30T00:47:26Z","merge_commit_sha":"ebd39da5948d26d9e0f0dc705134ad1b1d8c616e","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1299/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1299/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_u