iation":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1295","id":5069279603,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx8aUc8AAAABLicRcw","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1295","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1295.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1295.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1295","number":1295,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(test): keep the pooled-slot tier green on Windows, where its tests do not apply","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nFix Windows pooled-slot helper warnings while keeping the helpers linted wherever used. Allow empty test shards only when the unpartitioned tier selects tests; empty filters and empty unsplit runs still fail.\n\nFix a process-exit detection race behind teardown test failures, add regression coverage, and update libz-sys to address RUSTSEC-2026-0418.\n\n## Why\n\nThese CI failures block onepipeline pull requests from merging. Addressing their causes restores the merge path without relying on retries or weakening checks.","created_at":"2026-10-29T13:53:16Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T19:08:42Z","closed_at":"2026-10-29T19:08:40Z","merged_at":"2026-10-29T19:08:40Z","merge_commit_sha":"078c7d73bd942d8eae5575344b4be103961efd84","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1295/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1295/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1295/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/eccefd776352a04ba484abd3a871862de4b633ae","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/npm-engine-install/onepipeline-pooled-slot-windows","ref":"nick/npm-engine-install/onepipeline-pooled-slot-windows","sha":"eccefd776352a04ba484abd3a871862de4b633ae","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ni