?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nMake the store retry schedule journey tolerate slow runners by checking completed attempt records against the scheduled minimum waits, replacing polling-based timing ratios and the first-retry deadline. Retain detection of early retries and a 60-second backstop for missing retries.\n\n## Why\n\nIntermittent macOS failures in this journey are blocking unrelated pull requests from merging. Fixing the test’s timing assumptions addresses the cause instead of relying on reruns.","created_at":"2026-10-29T10:32:56Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T13:11:06Z","closed_at":"2026-10-29T13:11:04Z","merged_at":"2026-10-29T13:11:04Z","merge_commit_sha":"8543eb9f9e7cab9f01f6077880ca4d13a9d3f381","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1288/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1288/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.g