ps://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1268","number":1268,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(tests): make the activity-rule liveness test wait for the spawned tree to exit","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nStart each activity-rule test watch with a visible process-tree reading and retain it as the first sample. Preserve the idle, busy, and bursting assertions, including visibility on subsequent readings. Update `pulldown-cmark` to 0.13.5 to address the advisory blocking dependency checks.\n\n## Why\n\nA flaky failure in #1265’s required Mac proof job costs another roughly two-hour run and delays the engine release. Synchronizing the watch’s first sample addresses a startup timing gap instead of relying on reruns until the test passes.\n\n## Additional info\n\nThe linked `oneagentgraph` reader’s `scratch.rs::platform::enumerate` can omit a live PID when its arguments or start token is temporarily unreadable. That library behavior is fixed upstream in [oneagentgraph #244](https://github.com/nickderobertis/oneagentgraph/pull/244), included in the 0.9.1 [release PR #245](https://github.com/nickderobertis/oneagentgraph/pull/245). This branch still locks 0.9.0; it synchronizes test startup but does not yet consume the upstream fix.","created_at":"2026-10-28T16:02:28Z","updated_at":"2026-10-29T02:25:02Z","closed_at":"2026-10-29T02:25:00Z","merged_at":"2026-10-29T02:25:00Z","merge_commit_sha":"2bc70cb1177cb96cf0031aa5a0ee86c3e07f1138","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1268/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1268/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1268/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/ce1e03afe420bf1136bca99efc486ccdbf3dea63","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/npm-engine-install/onepipeline-liveness-mac-flake","ref":"nick/npm-engine-install/onepipeline-liveness-mac-flake","sha":"ce1e03afe420bf1136bca99efc486ccdbf3dea63","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/u