ks":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1273"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1273"},"issue":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1273"},"comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1273/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1273/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1273/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/d2ba1cf6f243285ab40daae30acfa0cce59df3ab"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1259","id":5047705616,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx8aUc8AAAABLN3gEA","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1259","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1259.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1259.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1259","number":1259,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(npm): run the npm launcher journeys on Windows","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nMake npm journeys resolve Windows command shims, including the installed launcher, budget checker and Nx, through `cmd.exe`. Preserve Windows paths and arguments, fix console interrupt setup, and report synchronous engine startup failures consistently; add cross-platform regression coverage to `just npm-launcher`.\n\nUpdate `pulldown-cmark` to 0.13.5 for RUSTSEC-2026-0414.\n\n## Why\n\nThe user's host now installs the engine from npm, so the launcher's process behaviour must work for Windows users too. The Windows journeys have been failing before reaching the launcher because direct spawns cannot start npm's command shims, leaving that behaviour unproven.","created_at":"2026-10-28T08:48:55Z","updated_at":"2026-10-28T20:51:15Z","closed_at":"2026-10-28T20:51:12Z","merged_at":"2026-10-28T20:51:12Z","merge_commit_sha":"4c4cf50aa9f35907bc6e0e5300d0b17004b88768","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1259/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1259/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1259/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/3bb7a1973f45f3a3d611156f82d057108d4fe1f2","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/npm-engine-install/onepipeline