 fixes [RUSTSEC-2026-0414](https://rustsec.org/advisories/RUSTSEC-2026-0414). Only the lockfile changes; no dependency requirement changes are needed.\n\n## Why\n\nThe advisory blocks the required dependency audit for this repository's pull requests, including the engine release carrying the plan store fix the user's host needs. Updating the dependency removes that blocker.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)","created_at":"2026-10-28T12:23:33Z","updated_at":"2026-10-28T20:44:50Z","closed_at":"2026-10-28T20:44:47Z","merged_at":"2026-10-28T20:44:47Z","merge_commit_sha":"80351e03118dcde782deb98134900ed038faef88","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1265/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1265/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1265/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/e42684aa1944f2fcf1c6b2bbbf17c1a83b346a42","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/npm-engine-install/onepipeline-pulldown-cmark-advisory","ref":"nick/npm-engine-install/onepipeline-pulldown-cmark-advisory","sha":"e42684aa1944f2fcf1c6b2bbbf17c1a83b346a42","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.githu