e.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline","homepage":null,"size":24249,"stargazers_count":1,"watchers_count":1,"language":"Rust","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":2,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":252,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":2,"open_issues":252,"watchers":1,"default_branch":"main"}},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1265"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1265"},"issue":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1265"},"comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1265/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1265/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1265/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/e42684aa1944f2fcf1c6b2bbbf17c1a83b346a42"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1266","id":5051802179,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx8aUc8AAAABLRxiQw","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1266","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1266.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1266.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1266","number":1266,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"test: attribute onepipeline's e2e test time and model a crate split","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nAdds per-test e2e cost recording, retained in Nx outputs and CI artifacts, with scripts for platform breakdowns and replaying historical PRs against a proposed crate split. Existing assertions and the coverage floor remain intact; one maintenance journey gets a longer closing interval to address its Windows timing failure.\n\n## Why\n\nPull-request checks take one to two and a half hours, delaying changes and occupying shared job slots. These measurements identify where coverage-preserving cuts can help reach the 30-minute goal. The proposed split alone is a net cost: it skips only 4.4% of suite runs and 4.0% of test-seconds while increasing measured compile and incremental-build costs, without reducing per-test work.\n\n## Additional info\n\nReplaces [PR #978](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/978), carrying its net change onto the current base without merges of main in the outgoing history.\n\n[The profile report](docs/test-profile-report.md) contains the Linux top-30 tests and top-10 modules, hosted platform comparisons, the 144-PR replay and mapping, prototype build costs, per-module coverage trade-offs, and the Windows maintenance diagnosis. Linux timings are a snapshot of `7a017fa` on the earlier branch, not measurements of this head. The recorder code, analysis scripts, profiling tests and golden remain unchanged from that snapshot; two recorder comments were corrected. Later base changes affect some profiled journeys, and the mapping now accounts for `linear_writeback`'s dependency on `publication_boundary`.\n\nThe only lockfile change is `pulldown-cmark` 0.13.4 → 0.13.5 for RUSTSEC-2026-0414. No engine refresh was needed: the base already links the newest permitted oneagentgraph 0.9.0, onevcs 0.57.0 and onevcs-testing 0.19.22. Revision-specific verification and its limits are recorded in the report.","created_at":"2026-10-28T14:02:08Z","updated_at":"2026-10-28T19:07:12Z","closed_at":"2026-10-28T19:07:09Z","merged_at":"2026-10-28T19:07:09Z","merge_commit_sha":"b0ce59cc40484264fe42adf27b89a32bd345be0e","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1266/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1266/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1266/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/71826e5da54c34218e31aab8fe9aa2a997b17715","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/959/onepipeline-t