}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1266/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/71826e5da54c34218e31aab8fe9aa2a997b17715"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1262","id":5049152221,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx8aUc8AAAABLPPy3Q","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1262","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1262.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1262.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1262","number":1262,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(deps): link the plan store that routes by organization and classification together","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nLink onetaskgraph 0.12.9 so hosts can combine repository patterns and classification in a route entry, and handle its new `task locate` error variants. Add a real-run journey covering private plan placement and live additions: both private and public additions remain in the private home, while the public plan source holds only recorded public views. Update pulldown-cmark to 0.13.5 to address RUSTSEC-2026-0414.\n\n## Why\n\nThe engine loads plans and writes settlements through its linked store. Hosts routing an owner’s private work by both organization and privacy need a store that accepts that configuration so those plans can run and write back without exposing private items.","created_at":"2026-10-28T10:44:51Z","updated_at":"2026-10-28T17:36:39Z","closed_at":"2026-10-28T17:36:36Z","merged_at":"2026-10-28T17:36:36Z","merge_commit_sha":"f9cbb111cdbd49bed365d2c2e155d9a1461ca417","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1262/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1262/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1262/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/144f9b83449bcaa96b83956fd2f921ba90144627","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/1242/pipeline-link-org-classification-routes","ref":"nick/1242/pipeline-link-org-classification-routes","sha":"144f9b83449bcaa96b83956fd2f921ba90144627","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/use