Update the linked onetaskgraph crates and test CLI to 0.12.8 so private Linear plan homes retain their public task projection records after Linear rewrites their content. Add coverage for live-add write-back and the linked store’s copy path that reproduces the regression.\n\n## Why\n\nThe host’s switch from PyPI to npm was accepted with the projection-loss regression in [onetaskgraph #3781](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3781). Shipping the fixed store alongside the npm launcher fixes lets the host adopt both together and retire its launcher workaround and expected-failure marker.","created_at":"2026-10-28T07:22:28Z","updated_at":"2026-10-28T12:04:20Z","closed_at":"2026-10-28T12:04:18Z","merged_at":"2026-10-28T12:04:18Z","merge_commit_sha":"62127512baf716119ab05b11dea0534efb5b1cd3","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1256/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1256/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1256/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/182b92cd85cdb11fe088b7d7badf089c9b7622cf","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/npm-engine-install/onepipeline-adopt-fixed-store","ref":"nick/npm-engine-install/onepipeline-adopt-fixed-store","sha":"182b92cd85cdb11fe088b7d7badf089c9b7622cf","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github