/onepipeline/pull/1234","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1234.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1234.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1234","number":1234,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(tests): make the settled-from-evidence adoption journey deterministic on Windows","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nFix a race where the driver could treat an in-flight settlement as already folded into its state, leaving dependent work stalled after the reply reported `applied`. Mark the settlement applied only after reconciliation finishes, and add a deterministic CLI journey that holds the claimer across driver passes to reproduce the ordering.\n\n## Why\n\nSound changes in the long-run driver recovery work were losing hours to Windows CI reruns. Correcting this race addresses a slow-runner ordering behind the settlement journey’s failure without retries or raised timeouts.",