w_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1228/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/c2870170171e9882b3c00eccf40387e8cbc0d823"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1225","id":5025314745,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx8aUc8AAAABK4g3uQ","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1225","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1225.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1225.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1225","number":1225,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(npm): ship the engine's CycloneDX SBOM in every npm platform package","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nShip `sboms/onepipeline.cyclonedx.json` in all four npm platform packages, using the same build-generated SBOM as the wheel. Staging verifies the documents match, and publication refuses packages with missing or invalid SBOMs even when PyPI publication is off.\n\n## Why\n\nPyPI publication is disabled after the project exceeded its storage limit, making npm the installation source for Python-free consumers. Bundling the SBOM with the binary lets consuming hosts verify linked crate versions and enforce their engine pins from a single install.","created_at":"2026-10-26T22:02:17Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T00:31:00Z","closed_at":"2026-10-27T00:30:58Z","merged_at":"2026-10-27T00:30:58Z","merge_commit_sha":"70427f2787bb3a70072e220316852351691f8b26","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1225/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1225/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1225/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/1f9470886e67a1688093cab0bd5e9c65701f8140","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/1221/onepipeline-npm-sbom","ref":"nick/1221/onepipeline-npm-sbom","sha":"1f9470886e67a1688093cab0bd5e9c65701f8140","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickder