/1219.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1219.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1219","number":1219,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"chore: release v0.95.0","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\n\n\n## 🤖 New release\n\n* `onepipeline`: 0.94.0 -> 0.95.0 (✓ API compatible changes)\n\n<details><summary><i><b>Changelog</b></i></summary><p>\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.95.0](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/compare/v0.94.0...v0.95.0) - 2026-10-26\n\n### Added\n\n- *(deps)* [**breaking**] link the plan store that records what Linear stores from each write ([#1212](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1212))\n\n### Performance\n\n- *(driver)* keep a driver's cost flat however large its journal grows, with liveness out of it ([#1200](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1200))\n</blockquote>\n\n\n</p></details>\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [release-plz](https://github.com/release-plz/release-plz/).","created_at":"2026-10-26T14:09:58Z","updated_at":"2026-10-26T18:25:25Z","closed_at":"2026-10-26T18:25:24Z","merged_at":"2026-10-26T18:25:24Z","merge_commit_sha":"36c0a2be81141e4c3456882923001aa1646a9f0c","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1219/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1219/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1219/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/98fcef3b6071cad4a907d17a9c1897de5258f102","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:release-plz-2026-10-26T14-09-54Z","ref":"release-plz-2026-10-26T14-09-54Z","sha":"98fcef3b6071cad4a907d17a9c1897de5258f102","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_a