/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nLink onetaskgraph 0.12.5 so public tasks in private plans retain `id`-only anchors and their fragment links when copied into public views. Add a regression journey through the linked store and adapt the Linear test endpoint and write-back expectations to the store’s changed write responses.\n\n## Why\n\nBudget anchors blocked mixed public/private plans from reaching the board, preventing ai-orchestrator from adopting the work to reduce Codex launch and helper network traffic and quota consumption ([oneharness#1442](https://github.com/nickderobertis/oneharness/issues/1442)). The host holds its plan-store version to the engine’s linked store, so adoption needs this engine update.\n\n## Additional info\n\nAll six `onetaskgraph-*` crates resolve once to registry release 0.12.5, carrying the anchor fix from [a60ee4e](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/commit/a60ee4e82313f5e7d61995ba194de6921e5bd4f9). The Git patch and source allowance are removed, and the provisioned test CLI version is aligned to 0.12.5.\n\n[Dependency work in #1200](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1200) also touches `Cargo.lock`; this branch changes only the store family’s resolution.","created_at":"2026-10-26T00:09:23Z","updated_at":"2026-10-26T03:57:55Z","closed_at":"2026-10-26T03:57:53Z","merged_at":"2026-10-26T03:57:53Z","merge_commit_sha":"dc6b5fd3813b459f0ce3f38dbeba1f7339c88d87","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1213/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1213/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1213/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/393a957e8bdd6517416950e9a231b144777e2c93","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/Share-one-Codex-app-server-across-dispatches-and-budget-network-data-per-launch/onepipeline-link-store-anchor-fix","ref":"nick/Share-one-Codex-app-server-across-dispatches-and-budget-network-data-per-launch/onepipeline-link-store-anchor-fix","sha":"393a957e8bdd6517416950e9a231b144777e2c93","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1327438417,"node_id":"R_kgDOTx8aUQ","name":"onepipeline","full_name":"nickderobertis/onepipeline","private":false,"owner":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://ap