{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nRelink onto oneagentgraph 0.9.0 and onejudge 0.22.0 so observer monitors use their own worker config. Add a regression journey through the released oneharness CLI covering the monitor’s first turn and watched status at launch and after adoption.\n\n## Why\n\nA launch directory’s oneharness config could kill the monitor on its first turn when it referenced an unset environment variable. Linking the fixes preserves the regular check-ins and goal-drift watch needed to notice stuck or misdirected workers.\n\n## Additional info\n\nBreaking dependency update: the engine’s public API exposes types from the incompatible library releases.","created_at":"2026-10-25T18:28:48Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T22:55:01Z","closed_at":"2026-10-25T22:54:58Z","merged_at":"2026-10-25T22:54:58Z","merge_commit_sha":"451170bd57bce4bc8eee57977caced7bfe7fa9a1","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.g