_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nMake the upstream-ledger polling journey judge read timing directly, removing its minimum loop-throughput requirement. It now rejects reads begun before the 500 ms interval is due while allowing correct polling on slow runners.\n\n## Why\n\nThe flaky Windows assertion blocks v0.91.1 (#1201), delaying the observer-process cleanup in #1186 and the onepipeline-ui release that carries it. Shipping that fix lets dispatch hosts stop leftover Codex launches and helpers consuming network and quota (nickderobertis/oneharness#1442).\n\n## Additional info\n\nWhen every pass takes longer than the read interval, correct polling and an every-pass reader make identical reads; no test can distinguish them in that case.\n\nThe manager left the onemessagebus lock move to #1200. This branch retains 0.9.3 and leaves the contract, channel layout declarations and bus CLI pin unchanged. It overlaps #1200 in `src/engine.rs`, `src/loopstats.rs` and `tests/e2e/harness.rs`.","created_at":"2026-10-25T17:29:47Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T19:19:12Z","closed_at":"2026-10-25T19:19:10Z","merged_at":"2026-10-25T19:19:10Z","merge_commit_sha":"cf5a092ad155b44867ac76ccffcbfbcc96b2f57e","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1206/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1206/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1206/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/babc6614d937c68b7a4f6764cb9fb4f8b0699e04","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/Share-one-Codex-app-server-across-dispatches-and-budget-network-data-per-launch/onepipeline-u