":"## What\n\nRelink to onevcs 0.57.0 and onevcs-testing 0.19.22 so engine-screened public writes honor the host’s public phrases. Phrase-list changes invalidate cached passes; bare private terms remain refused, and malformed phrase files make checks unavailable. Add end-to-end coverage for these cases.\n\n## Why\n\nEngine write-backs, replies and notes must agree with the host’s own commands about what is public. This removes refusals for host-approved phrases while ensuring a withdrawn phrase cannot remain allowed through a cached pass.\n\n## Additional info\n\nBreaking dependency update: the public onevcs `Unavailability` enum gains `PublicPhrases`, and this crate’s public surface carries onevcs types.","created_at":"2026-10-25T16:21:59Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T18:51:02Z","closed_at":"2026-10-25T18:51:00Z","merged_at":"2026-10-25T18:51:00Z","merge_commit_sha":"b4ca738b7588660ccd449e29f25900cb5a5d3f90","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1205/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1205/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1205/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/1a8f6df3baead82cca8e69c272e8ae0e77592bb2","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/1158/op-link-public-phrases","ref":"nick/1158/op-link-public-phrases","sha":"1a8f6df3baead82cca8e69c272e8ae0e77592bb2","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users