_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1186","id":5003277644,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx8aUc8AAAABKjf1TA","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1186","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1186.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1186.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1186","number":1186,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(observer): end the monitor's judge command when its run ends","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nEnd a settled run’s observer processes, including long-lived command judges, before its driver exits. The driver previously queued cancellation on a relay thread and could exit before cleanup ran; it now signals the observer directly, waits, and reaps its processes even if cancellation fails or teardown stalls. This covers attached and detached runs while leaving other runs’ observers running.\n\n## Why\n\nOrphaned observers keep consuming network and quota after nobody is watching their run. They also fail ai-orchestrator’s test-session teardown, blocking reliable dispatches and adoption of Codex plugins off by default on this host.","created_at":"2026-10-25T08:54:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T14:09:38Z","closed_at":"2026-10-25T14:09:35Z","merged_at":"2026-10-25T14:09:35Z","merge_commit_sha":"670b837c123d69160052034b7ee827e100056505","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1186/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1186/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1186/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/6242660e87377bcb3864c92f8fd8ccabf9f7b641","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/Share-one-Codex-app-server-across-dispatches-and-budget-network-data-per-launch/onepipeline-observer-judge-ends-with-run","ref":"nick/Share-one-Codex-app-server-across-dispatches-and-budget-network-data-per-launch/onepipeline-observer-judge-ends-with-run","sha":"6242660e87377bcb3864c92f8fd8ccabf9f7b641","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.co