eld run’s driver through the test harness and asserting it has exited before replacing the merged event store with an unreadable directory. The driver’s append handle excludes deletion on Windows; the test still proves the same verdict from watch state alone.\n\n## Why\n\nKeep main green without weakening the unreadable-store coverage. This failure stops the Windows shard at its first failing test, hiding every later result.","created_at":"2026-10-25T05:10:21Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T07:41:30Z","closed_at":"2026-10-25T07:41:28Z","merged_at":"2026-10-25T07:41:28Z","merge_commit_sha":"da974fcae786687333755d0a61f499e174c8136e","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1160/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1160/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1160/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/c1005c998e936a91658fbbf9e3adcf78bdb5fd77","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/Read-a-task-s-cross-tracker-dependencies-only-where-they-can-be-and-cheaply/windows-stop-guard-store","ref":"nick/Read-a-task-s-cross-tracker-dependencies-only-where-they-can-be-and-cheaply/windows-stop-guard-store","sha":"c1005c998e936a91658fbbf9e3adcf78bdb5fd77","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.git