rtis/onepipeline/pull/1152.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1152.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1152","number":1152,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat!: execute private coordination plans with task-owned visibility","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nAllow public tasks to run within a private coordinating plan using the store’s task-owned visibility. Keep canonical tasks and write-back in the private home, with store-managed public projections and screened exports to public consumers. Update boundary guidance and add real CLI regression coverage for mixed plans, export continuity and projection failures.\n\n## Why\n\nA public consumer needs the generalized commit and its own task, while the scheduler needs the private graph. Keeping those views separate makes the export path usable without exposing private coordination context.\n\n## Additional info\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: Upgrade onetaskgraph to 0.12.1; public `Node.classification` and `TaskRecord.source` expose dependency types across the store’s minor-version boundary. Boundary guidance advances to schema version 2. The approved contract amendment is recorded in `docs/contract-divergences.md`, entry 140. Existing private task classifications remain private; no classification setting or mode is required.","created_at":"2026-10-24T19:58:17Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T06:54:38Z","closed_at":"2026-10-25T06:54:36Z","merged_at":"2026-10-25T06:54:36Z","merge_commit_sha":"c71ac47956c7a218d550a224c351e8e262d8ea5d","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1152/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1152/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1152/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/6692d0791aea4164aae21a91e199ad43b78ec79c","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/1109/engine","ref":"nick/1109/engine","sha":"6692d0791aea4164aae21a91e199ad43b78ec79c","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https:/