rtis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nReplace private references in current tracked files with generic descriptions that preserve their meaning.\n\n## Why\n\nPublic repositories' current files must contain no private repository references or content. This addresses references remaining after the earlier cleanup without rewriting existing history.\n\n## Additional info\n\nChanged locations and their base screening results:\n\n- `docs/windows-journey-audit.md:177` — passed at the base; generic rewording.\n- `scripts/session-setup.sh:70` — refused at the base.\n- `tests/recorded/channel/domain-driven-modularity-2/replies.jsonl:1` — refused at the base.\n- `tests/recorded/channel/domain-driven-modularity-2/replies.jsonl:2` — refused at the base.\n\nThe finished-tree boundary check reports no hits outside these accidental binary payload collisions, whose files remain byte-for-byte unchanged:\n\n- `screenshots/fonts/JetBrainsMono-Regular.ttf` (one hit)\n- `screenshots/images/demo.gif` (several hits)\n- `screenshots/images/help.svg:7`\n- `screenshots/images/monitor.svg:7`\n- `screenshots/images/results.svg:7`\n- `screenshots/images/runs.svg:7`\n- `screenshots/images/status.svg:7`\n- `screenshots/images/telemetry.svg:7`\n- `screenshots/images/watch.svg:7`\n\nThe font and the GIF carry no line numbers here: a line number in a binary file depends on which bytes a reader counts as line breaks, so it would not be reproducible.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","created_at":"2026-10-14T13:39:17Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T05:11:44Z","closed_at":"2026-10-25T05:11:41Z","merged_at":"2026-10-25T05:11:41Z","merge_commit_sha":"56b2944753dc9d8981f1dffd7391f9f30346612c","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.co