s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\n\n\n## 🤖 New release\n\n* `onepipeline`: 0.89.3 -> 0.90.0 (✓ API compatible changes)\n\n<details><summary><i><b>Changelog</b></i></summary><p>\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.90.0](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/compare/v0.89.3...v0.90.0) - 2026-10-25\n\n### Added\n\n- [**breaking**] hold a node only on trackers its edges name, until the provider's reset ([#1153](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1153))\n\n### Fixed\n\n- *(tests)* keep three of onepipeline's e2e journeys reliable on a loaded runner ([#1086](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1086))\n</blockquote>\n\n\n</p></details>\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [release-plz](https://github.com/release-plz/release-plz/).","created_at":"2026-10-25T01:26:12Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T03:31:37Z","closed_at":"2026-10-25T03:31:36Z","merged_at":"2026-10-25T03:31:36Z","merge_commit_sha":"c8ecf8258e761259745d94bc517c3ff99d13758a","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1156/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1156/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1156/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/cf2df2b3120599a7d2ae7731148caf2902bb086e","head":{"label":"nickd