e/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1156/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/cf2df2b3120599a7d2ae7731148caf2902bb086e"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":{"enabled_by":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1086","id":4952778067,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx8aUc8AAAABJzVlUw","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1086","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1086.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1086.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1086","number":1086,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(tests): keep three of onepipeline's e2e journeys reliable on a loaded runner","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nGive the busy review-round journey exclusive use of its e2e test group and require onevcs 0.56.11 for coordinated session reads and closes, pooled-identity deadlock fixes, and reduced git process starts. Make adoption wait for an observed release hold and an answered status read, and make the backfill journey wait for driver ownership to end before recording.\n\nAdd deterministic regression coverage and actionable diagnostics for stalled commands, unexpected branch-rule reads, and Linear writeback failures. Assert every review-round session closes while retaining existing assertions, nextest timeouts, and git-start bounds.\n\n## Why\n\nIntermittent required-check failures have made sound changes take hours of reruns to land, blocking recovery of a long multi-repository run. Addressing contention and lifecycle races reduces those failures; richer diagnostics make failures whose causes remain unresolved actionable.","created_at":"2026-10-21T13:56:01Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T01:25:17Z","closed_at":"2026-10-25T01:25:15Z","merged_at":"2026-10-25T01:25:15Z","merge_commit_sha":"5080514bde6ae3e8d46588a950ca8736f2bd1b44","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1086/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1086/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1086/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/e884e05cc2abbd04a125c41ec89e27082ccc8675","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/Keep-a-long-run-s-driver-responsive-however-large-its-journal-grows-and-stop-it-cancelling-its-own-work/op-ci-flakes","ref":"nick/Keep-a-long-run-s-driver-responsive-however-large-its-journal-grows-and-stop-it-cancelling-its-own-work/op-ci-flakes","sha":"e884e05cc2abbd04a125c41ec89e27082ccc8675","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"ht