"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":252,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":2,"open_issues":252,"watchers":1,"default_branch":"main"}},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1086"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1086"},"issue":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1086"},"comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1086/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1086/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1086/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/e884e05cc2abbd04a125c41ec89e27082ccc8675"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1153","id":4998727532,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx8aUc8AAAABKfKHbA","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1153","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1153.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1153.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1153","number":1153,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat!: hold a node only on trackers its edges name, until the provider's reset","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nLink onetaskgraph 0.12.0 so nodes hold only on sources their dependency reads name. Replace fixed polling with shared, per-source re-reads after provider resets or capped exponential backoff, and show the source, cause and next read in launch notices, status and source-wait surfaces. Replace the Linear-specific settlement budget with store-operation telemetry and budgets for holds, dispatches and settlements.\n\n## Why\n\nMinute-by-minute reads of unrelated private trackers drained shared credentials and stalled unrelated work. Scoped reads and reset-aware waits preserve quota and let unaffected tasks proceed, while clearer hold messages help managers decide whether to wait or act.\n\n## Additional info\n\nThe store upgrade changes types exposed by the public API and requires a breaking minor release before 1.0. Hold records add `cause` and an optional provider reset, `retry_at_ms`; existing journals remain readable with their original text. Holds still have no timeout, and rate-limit guidance no longer asks for replacement credentials.\n\nA node held on several sources is re-read when any is due and none is waiting for a provider reset plus one second. A reset therefore delays that node’s other sources because the store cannot exclude a source from a dependency read; separate nodes retain independent schedules. A follow-up asks onetaskgraph for per-source exclusion or a way to seed known resets.","created_at":"2026-10-24T20:07:45Z","updated_at":"2026-10-25T01:23:18Z","closed_at":"2026-10-25T01:23:16Z","merged_at":"2026-10-25T01:23:16Z","merge_commit_sha":"37e23215f465db131da341e29daf87c0a03cad36","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1153/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1153/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1153/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/44b47259591217852b238f804a1412a56221b11f","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/1089/engine","ref":"nick/1089/engine","sha":"44b47259591217852b238f804a1412a56221b11f","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/