tps://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1155"},"issue":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1155"},"comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1155/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1155/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1155/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/664b086e00cc3bd093beb70932572f6238a999eb"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":{"enabled_by":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1116","id":4977273300,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx8aUc8AAAABKKsp1A","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1116","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1116.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1116.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1116","number":1116,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(driver): stop reading the project claim on a timer and never end work over a failed read","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nReplace periodic driver-claim polling and lease expiry with ownership checks at adoption and before fenced publications. Missing claims let work publish; failed, timed-out or rate-limited reads hold only the pending publication while dispatches continue. Explicit takeovers keep the two drivers’ publications from overlapping.\n\n## Why\n\nRoutine ownership checks consume board quota shared by every session even though ownership changes require explicit user action. Missing claims and failed reads were repeatedly ending healthy work—six consecutive attempts of one node roughly ten minutes into each—without any takeover having occurred.\n\n## Additional info\n\n`ONEPIPELINE_CLAIM_INTERVAL_SECONDS` remains accepted and now controls only takeover polling. A displaced driver stops starting work once it observes the takeover; until then it may still start dispatches. A publication check that finds the successor’s claim withholds that publication. Publications already in progress finish before the takeover proceeds. Takeovers wait for acknowledgement or the displaced driver’s cancel grace plus ten seconds with no publication fence standing.\n\nThe events bundle advances to `1.10.1` for the revised `ClaimLease` descriptions.","created_at":"2026-10-23T03:15:46Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T22:04:00Z","closed_at":"2026-10-24T22:03:58Z","merged_at":"2026-10-24T22:03:58Z","merge_commit_sha":"7d2be8f311dcff53a49731e91938bbaaca556418","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1116/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1116/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1116/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/934966f01bd2b87798ffd95eae6246425ae90585","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/Repository-publication-boundary/driver-claim-no-polling","ref":"nick/Repository-publication-boundary/driver-claim-no-polling","sha":"934966f01bd2b87798ffd95eae6246425ae90585","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","fol