ons_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1117","id":4977557111,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx8aUc8AAAABKK9-dw","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1117","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1117.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1117.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1117","number":1117,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(retirement): leave a branch a node comes to name during a retirement pass","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nRetirement now asks the driver which branches live nodes name at each repository identity, so an acknowledged edit protects its branch even before the driver finishes its loop pass. A closing driver cuts short retirement waiting for that answer.\n\nThe two affected retirement journeys deterministically force the previously racy ordering, with bounded failpoint waits that report the step and last observed state. Their Unix-only helpers are gated consistently to avoid Windows unused-code errors.\n\n## Why\n\nSound changes in the long multi-repository recovery run were intermittently failing retirement checks and costing hours of reruns. Removing the stale-state race protects newly named branches and makes these journeys reliable under host load.","created_at":"2026-10-23T03:54:29Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T17:15:42Z","closed_at":"2026-10-24T17:15:41Z","merged_at":"2026-10-24T17:15:41Z","merge_commit_sha":"52f93145b522a94a2de96177ccee9af06cce4006","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1117/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1117/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1117/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/7621dd3c23302c71a24f92e73f762fa5aa9af50d","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/Keep-a-long-run-s-driver-responsive-however-large-its-journal-grows-and-stop-it-cancelling-its-own-work/op-ci-flake-retirement","ref":"nick/Keep-a-long-run-s-driver-responsive-however-large-its-journal-grows-and-stop-it-cancelling-its-own-work/op-ci-flake-retirement","sha":"7621dd3c23302c71a24f92e73f762fa5aa9af50d","user":{"login":"nick