ollowers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1133","id":4993130441,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx8aUc8AAAABKZ0fyQ","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1133","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1133.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1133.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1133","number":1133,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"perf(review): start far fewer git processes in a busy review round","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nReduce repeated landing checks during attached review rounds: retain reads through publication steps that do not change a landing, share recent answers between rendering and close-out, and read branches shared by original and rework nodes once. Reuse stays within the existing freshness window and invalidates when relevant state changes.\n\nLower the current git-process budgets to 14,000 on Linux and 20,000 on macOS, preserving the busy round’s outcome and spending assertions. Also restrict a Unix-only test helper to Unix to fix Windows lint.\n\n## Why\n\nBusy review rounds repeatedly time out on the required Windows check, blocking unrelated fixes—including the stop fix needed to prevent lingering Codex launches from consuming network and quota. Reducing repeated git starts addresses that cost and makes real review rounds cheaper, following the request to fix flaky tests rather than abandon them.\n\n## Additional info\n\nMeasured Linux counts with main’s linked onevcs 0.56.9 fell from 15,097–16,398 to 11,435–11,809. The macOS budget is derived from main’s recorded counts scaled by the Linux savings; it is not a measurement of this tree. Windows timeout resolution still needs platform CI.\n\nEarlier measurements against `64abf6f1` were 11,035–11,278 before and 8,969–9,210 after the initial reduction, with a proposed 10,750 budget. Those figures predate the merge of main and do not describe the finished tree.\n\nThis remains a partial reduction: it does **not** meet the requested 7,500 ceiling, and the Linux budget has about 22% headroom over the lowest measured count. Further reductions to repeated repository, reference and landing reads inside onevcs remain a separate follow-up; this diff keeps the onevcs version main links.","created_at":"2026-10-24T06:27:26Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T12:54:36Z","closed_at":"2026-10-24T12:54:35Z","merged_at":"2026-10-24T12:54:35Z","merge_commit_sha":"8737b646b7b176c9414521a3a958f7ce84935e1b","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1133/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1133/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1133/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/efdefe08cbed12f101788432bb832bf3041b9d0c","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/Share-one-Codex-app-server-across-dispatches-and-budget-network-data-per-launch/onepipeline-review-round-fewer-git-processes","ref":"nick/Share-one-Codex-app-server-across-dispatches-and-budget-network-data-per-launch/onepipeline-review-round-fewer-git-processes","sha":"efdefe08cbed12f101788432bb832bf3041b9d0c","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nick