gnee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1132","id":4991786620,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx8aUc8AAAABKYiefA","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1132","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1132.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1132.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1132","number":1132,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(tests): keep the three-manager landing and public-id claim journeys reliable","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nAvoid Git’s optional index locks during concurrent manager landings while preserving explicit operator settings. Shutdown now also stops dispatches admitted during teardown, preventing orphaned work from holding run directories open on Windows, and reports survivors within the existing teardown bound.\n\nAdd deterministic regression journeys and replace timing assumptions with observed states. Correct the continuation journey’s synchronization so shutdown’s additional process listing can finish while preserving takeover coverage.\n\n## Why\n\nSound changes should pass CI on their first attempt. These intermittent failures were costing hours of reruns and blocking fixes needed to restore a long multi-repository run whose driver had fallen behind its journal.","created_at":"2026-10-24T02:29:15Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T08:43:01Z","closed_at":"2026-10-24T08:42:58Z","merged_at":"2026-10-24T08:42:58Z","merge_commit_sha":"a5d7514cbfe7390396775abfb57cc59202bfd08f","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1132/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1132/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1132/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/25d637374e5c3cc2627ec3d22f07d96e867a3c9e","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/Keep-a-long-run-s-driver-responsive-however-large-its-journal-grows-and-stop-it-cancelling-its-own-work/op-ci-flakes-landings-publicid","ref":"nick/Keep-a-long-run-s-driver-responsive-however-large-its-journal-grows-and-stop-it-cancelling-its-own-work/op-ci-flakes-landings-publicid","sha":"25d637374e5c3cc2627ec3d22f07d96e867a3c9e","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followi