privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nUpgrade the linked onetaskgraph libraries and CLI to 0.11.1 so write-back’s image step rewrites shadow task documents atomically. Add regression coverage for readers spanning a rewrite and interrupted writes followed by a successful retry.\n\n## Why\n\nThe store previously truncated documents in place, exposing readers to empty or partially written tasks. This could corrupt plan-store reads and intermittently fail the overlapping-projections journey, costing hours of CI reruns while fixes needed to restore a long multi-repository run waited to land.","created_at":"2026-10-23T23:06:56Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T05:17:32Z","closed_at":"2026-10-24T05:17:29Z","merged_at":"2026-10-24T05:17:29Z","merge_commit_sha":"314bdbef8cce4811392558658d0b8c6a7c266951","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1130/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1130/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1130/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/ab8323675ecd8af57d7b6f3f33332241a8045971","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/Keep-a-long-run-s-driver-responsive-however-large-its-journal-grows-and-stop-it-cancelling-its-own-work/op-ci-flake-writeback-torn","ref":"nick/Keep-a-long-run-s-driver-responsive-however-large-its-journal-grows-and-stop-it-cancelling-its-own-work/op-ci-flake-writeback-torn","sha":"ab8323675ecd8af57d7b6f3f33332241a8045971","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_u