ckderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1124.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1124","number":1124,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"chore: release v0.88.0","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\n\n\n## 🤖 New release\n\n* `onepipeline`: 0.87.1 -> 0.88.0 (⚠ API breaking changes)\n\n### ⚠ `onepipeline` breaking changes\n\n```text\n--- failure constructible_struct_adds_field: struct exhaustively constructible through public API adds field ---\n\nDescription:\nA pub struct that could be exhaustively constructed with a literal using only public API has a new pub field, breaking existing exhaustive literals.\n        ref: https://doc.rust-lang.org/reference/expressions/struct-expr.html\n       impl: https://github.com/obi1kenobi/cargo-semver-checks/tree/v0.51.0/src/lints/constructible_struct_adds_field.ron\n\nFailed in:\n  field AdoptArgs.writeback_item_budget in /tmp/.tmprIsnfq/onepipeline/src/cli.rs:785\n```\n\n<details><summary><i><b>Changelog</b></i></summary><p>\n\n<blockquote>\n\n## [0.88.0](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/compare/v0.87.1...v0.88.0) - 2026-10-23\n\n### Added\n\n- *(adopt)* let an adoption revise the run's per-item write-back budget ([#1122](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1122))\n\n### Fixed\n\n- *(tests)* keep the observer-finished and refused-note tests reliable on Windows ([#1114](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1114))\n- *(deps)* move tokio past RUSTSEC-2026-0386 ([#1127](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1127))\n</blockquote>\n\n\n</p></details>\n\n---\nThis PR was generated with [release-plz](https://github.com/release-plz/release-plz/).","created_at":"2026-10-23T16:55:48Z","updated_at":"2026-10-24T00:00:40Z","closed_at":"2026-10-24T00:00:38Z","merged_at":"2026-10-24T00:00:38Z","merge_commit_sha":"5cb58e351f70717c4bd8060accbb843ba444732a","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1124/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1124/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1124/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/9d99864b3477ae0e75f9633978a66e8af48e0f4b","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:release-plz-2026-10-23T16-55-45Z","ref":"release-plz-2026-10-23T16-55-45Z","sha":"9d99864b3477ae0e75f9633978a66e8af48e0f4b","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","f