:"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1114","id":4977033749,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx8aUc8AAAABKKeCFQ","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1114","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1114.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1114.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1114","number":1114,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(tests): keep the observer-finished and refused-note tests reliable on Windows","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nFix views that could label a live driver `DRIVER DEAD` before its first journal append or hide recorded note outcomes behind a stale inbox sidecar. Add deterministic CLI regressions and wait explicitly for sidecar cleanup.\n\nKeep periodic claim reads outside idle-cost measurement windows without raising bounds or weakening zero-store-read assertions. Make smoke cleanup resolve ambiguous GitHub close/delete failures by reading back the outcome, with bounded retries for transient read failures and explicit failures for unreadable listings.\n\n## Why\n\nSound changes should pass Windows CI on their first attempt. These flakes cost hours of reruns and interrupt the multi-repository work restoring reliable driver operation for long-running pipelines. Smoke cleanup should likewise recognize completed operations when GitHub fails to acknowledge them, while still failing when resources remain or their state cannot be established.","created_at":"2026-10-23T02:44:39Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T22:16:01Z","closed_at":"2026-10-23T22:15:58Z","merged_at":"2026-10-23T22:15:58Z","merge_commit_sha":"a379ab5f59c65ef35aab503a7a78040352bf7429","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1114/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1114/comments","review_c