epipeline/deployments","created_at":"2026-08-08T05:18:50Z","updated_at":"2026-11-01T09:13:42Z","pushed_at":"2026-11-01T09:36:05Z","git_url":"git://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:nickderobertis/onepipeline.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline","homepage":null,"size":24249,"stargazers_count":1,"watchers_count":1,"language":"Rust","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":2,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":252,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":2,"open_issues":252,"watchers":1,"default_branch":"main"}},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1127"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1127"},"issue":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1127"},"comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1127/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1127/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1127/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/6df712c0a0f53b75d3cb961c65d052ed7704cd3f"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1122","id":4981253988,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx8aUc8AAAABKOfnZA","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1122","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1122.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1122.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1122","number":1122,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(adopt): let an adoption revise the run's per-item write-back budget","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nAdd `adopt --writeback-item-budget <SECONDS>` for attached and detached adoption. The replacement budget persists for this and later drivers; zero is refused without writes, and omitting the flag preserves the recorded value regardless of the environment. An additive SDK entry point preserves the existing `verbs::adopt` and `verbs::Adopt` shapes.\n\n## Why\n\nA run whose recorded budget is too small keeps timing out on board projections after adoption. Raising it during adoption repairs the run without abandoning and relaunching it, preserving continuity and saving manager time.\n\nCloses #658\n\n## Additional info\n\nVerification evidence is for head `4790d32d380c3c7ec93f15d05e138ae6e2124610`:\n\n- The local `adoption_replaces_the_budget_and_later_adoptions_keep_it` journey passed through `just test-e2e` (208.727s). Both adoption modes cover persisting 30, retaining it despite a later environment override, refusing zero without changing the launch record, and completing writes held for two seconds and beyond the old 61-second deadline.\n- Local `just _crate-fmt-check`, `git diff --check`, and `cargo clippy --locked --lib --bin onepipeline --test contract --test e2e --quiet -- -D warnings` passed. CI passed all 138 contract tests. [Judged diff lint](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/actions/runs/39954165181/job/120415722052) passed: history `20261023T123610Z-10f20`, 14 passed, 0 failed.\n- The [Linux gate](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/actions/runs/39954165181/job/120415722307) failed `writeback_projections::overlapping_projections_never_show_a_reader_a_torn_shadow_document` after reading an empty shadow task document. It reproduced in two of three same-build CI reruns; the isolated existing test passed locally (33.511s). This was assessed as unrelated to this change and associated with #1111's shadow-writer work; a follow-up was drafted, and no repair, test adjustment, timeout change, or flake-list entry is included here.\n- The [Windows cross proof shard 2/2](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/actions/runs/39954165181/job/120415867519) timed out in `review_round::the_busy_review_round_ends_answered_and_true_and_records_what_it_spent` at 540s. All three same-build CI reruns passed. This was assessed as unrelated; no timeout, code, or flake-list change is included.\n\nCompatibility: `cargo semver-checks check-release -p onepipeline --baseline-rev v0.81.0` exited 0 but inferred a major change and skipped checks. With `--release-type patch`, it executed 223 checks (219 passed, four failing categories; exit 100). It reported no breaking change for `verbs::adopt` or `verbs::Adopt`, whose source signatures also match the tag. Whole-crate findings include the new public `AdoptArgs.writeback_item_budget` field, which affects exhaustive struct literals, and prior changes in `Node`, `RunReading`, `Receipt`, `StartArgs`, `RunSummary`, `RunView`, `Command`, `Delivery`, and `CommandVerdict`. This establishes the specified verbs compatibility boundary, not whole-crate patch compatibility with v0.81.0.\n\nSuppression accounting: `tests/e2e/writeback_budget.rs` adds a site-scoped `expensive_tests_stay_behind_their_own_edge` rationale because proving the deadline change requires waiting beyond 61 seconds in each mode through the existing crate e2e boundary. The changed dispatch call remains covered by existing `src/driver.rs` suppressions for `changed_behavior_has_e2e` (settlement output ordering is covered by parity/run-end-hook journeys) and `no_panics_on_recoverable_errors` (stream-write exit-code behavior follows a shared contract decision).","created_at":"2026-10-23T10:18:10Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T16:52:33Z","closed_at":"2026-10-23T16:52:31Z","merged_at":"2026-10-23T16:52:31Z","merge_commit_sha":"5b5c5436dc3b24685c4472e602264d160ed015a6","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1122/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1122/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1122/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/4790d32d380c3c7ec93f15d05e138ae6e2124610","head":{"label":"nickderoberti