llowers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"merge_method":"squash","commit_title":null,"commit_message":null},"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1111","id":4974320127,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTx8aUc8AAAABKH4Z_w","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1111","diff_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1111.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pull/1111.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1111","number":1111,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"perf(writeback)!: add a node to an existing board project without reading or rewriting it","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nLive-added nodes use `CopyScope::MembersOnly` to create tasks under existing board projects without reading or writing the project item. Initial routed-project creation retains the full-copy fallback, and settlement continues projecting task status. Regression journeys cover project preservation, routed creation, budget accounting, and stalled-lookup recovery.\n\n## Why\n\nEach add removes the defensive project read from the GitHub allowance shared by sessions on the host, while leaving a person's edited project title, body, labels and metadata untouched.\n\n## Additional info\n\nUses [onetaskgraph 0.11.0](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/releases/tag/v0.11.0), carrying `otg-member-copy`, `otg-preserve-status` and `otg-target-task`. This breaking dependency update affects re-exported public plan-store types. Settlement retains source status rather than adopting preserve-destination status policy.\n\nThe committed comparable-plan measurement falls from 138 to 133 protocol calls and from 45 to 40 scripted-source requests/GraphQL points: the defensive project read, the copy's project comparison and dependency read, and two project status-conversion calls disappear. These are scripted-source measurements, not production GitHub request counts; the member-copy spent record retains its four-request, four-point GraphQL budget.\n\nConsumer adoption for [onetaskgraph#3084](https://github.com/nickderobertis/onetaskgraph/issues/3084).","created_at":"2026-10-22T21:24:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T08:20:35Z","closed_at":"2026-10-23T08:20:32Z","merged_at":"2026-10-23T08:20:32Z","merge_commit_sha":"a9b6da879fbd1d39e728c42d5463eb262ff29e25","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1111/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/1111/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/issues/1111/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nickderobertis/onepipeline/statuses/aa3622a8df62e1d551709835a5cf3e03d18b18a0","head":{"label":"nickderobertis:nick/1093/op-member-copy-writeback","ref":"nick/1093/op-member-copy-writeback","sha":"aa3622a8df62e1d551709835a5cf3e03d18b18a0","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1327438417,"node_id":"R_kgDOTx8aUQ","name":"onepipeline","full_name"