 whose approval takes one request per call","user":{"login":"nickderobertis","id":19440155,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDQwMTU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19440155?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis","html_url":"https://github.com/nickderobertis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nickderobertis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What\n\nLink the engine and its test CLI to onetaskgraph 0.11.0, keeping the entire store family on one release. Adapt to its breaking copy API while preserving existing plan-loading and settlement write-back behavior.\n\n## Why\n\nThe host keeps its plan-store CLI, engine, and read API on the same store release. This relink lets the read API and ai-orchestrator adopt the release that lists a GitHub Projects plan’s members and writes its document metadata in one request each, helping bring approval from roughly 16 budget points toward the approved bar of 5.\n\n## Additional info\n\nThis is a breaking dependency update because store types reach the engine’s public surface. Copies retain source-status behavior and do not opt into explicit destination-task targeting.","created_at":"2026-10-23T03:12:27Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T05:29:31Z","closed_at":"2026-10-23T05:29:29Z","merged_at":"2026-10-23T05:29:29Z","merge_commit_